{"id":"bf2946fd-a098-4230-af8f-6177f24a88b9","object":"chat.completion","created":1787671191,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"ZTS501 means the handler needs a `Proof<T, P>` capsule because the cache import is stateful (breaks the default `read_only` profile). Since `cacheGet` is a read effect, I'll claim `state_isolated` rather than `deterministic`. Let me simulate the draft before proposing, given the attempt budget.","reasoning_content":"The veto says: ZTS501: handler returns no Proof<T, P> capsule; the default profile's read_only conflicts with a stateful module import.

